<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηδ-έω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span> cj. in <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ant.</u>
			414
		</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Q.S.
			10.29
		</span></i>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.376
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκήδεσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.427
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηδής</span>):—<i>take no
				care for, no heed of</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ τίς εὑ ἀκήδεσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μέν μευ ζώοντος ἀκήδεις, ἀλλὰ
					θανόντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.70
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαυτοῦ δ᾽ ἀκήδει
			δυστυχοῦντος</span> (imper.) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				508
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				4.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				33.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>grow
				weary</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				10.16
			</span></i>. (See also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφειδέω</span>.)</div>
